        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> Inscr.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðis is seo gerædnyss hu mon þæt hundred haldan sceal.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">This is the ordinance concerning the administration of the hundred.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Hoc est iudicium, qualiter hundredum teneri debeat.</ab>
